sequenceDiagram
    participant W as Writer
    participant H as Mailbox header
    participant E as Higher entry shard
    participant R as Reader
    W->>H: CAS: reserve UID / MODSEQ, pending journal
    H-->>W: new version
    R->>H: read changes since MODSEQ
    H-->>R: pending: do not skip the watermark
    W->>E: write message entry
    E-->>W: durable
    W->>H: complete pending change
    H-->>W: committed
    R->>H: synchronize again
    R->>E: read affected UID
    Note over H,E: No atomic transaction<br/>across both objects
